WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.406 --> 00:00:16.486
Roxy looked outside.

2
00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:19.829
The Electric Elves ran to their motorcycles.

3
00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:24.532
Zap! Electricity shot from the elf leader's hand.

4
00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:26.854
All the motorcycles started up.

5
00:00:27.815 --> 00:00:29.156
Rumble! Rumble!

6
00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:34.022
The Electric Elves hopped onto the motorcycles and rode away.

7
00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:41.369
"Grr!" Roxy stamped her foot.

8
00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:44.952
"The elves' clubhouse is really far from here.

9
00:00:44.972 --> 00:00:47.074
And I can't fly!"

10
00:00:48.175 --> 00:00:48.975
Roxy sighed.

11
00:00:48.995 --> 00:00:52.158
"I've lost my super powers.

12
00:00:53.359 --> 00:00:54.961
But I'm still Rocket Girl.

13
00:00:55.821 --> 00:00:58.424
And Rocket Girl can still stop those elves!"

14
00:01:00.808 --> 00:01:02.909
Roxy went outside and stomped down the street.

15
00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:05.090
A few people stared at her.

16
00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:08.792
"That's strange," said a man with a dog.

17
00:01:08.812 --> 00:01:11.874
"Rocket Girl is taking a walk!"

18
00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:19.778
aren't you flying, Rocket Girl?"

19
00:01:20.439 --> 00:01:21.259
asked a little girl.

20
00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:23.761
Roxy sighed and kept walking.

21
00:01:27.583 --> 00:01:29.684
Finally she got to the Electric Elves' clubhouse.

22
00:01:30.876 --> 00:01:32.597
She was tired and she was mad!

23
00:01:33.798 --> 00:01:36.440
The elves' motorcycles were parked in front of the clubhouse.

24
00:01:37.581 --> 00:01:39.342
Electricity buzzed all around them.

25
00:01:40.703 --> 00:01:42.405
Roxy kicked a motorcycle hard.

26
00:01:43.666 --> 00:01:44.786
Zap! Zap!

27
00:01:45.827 --> 00:01:48.129
"Whoa!" Roxy felt another shock.

28
00:01:48.969 --> 00:01:50.811
Electricity buzzed through her again.

29
00:01:51.651 --> 00:01:55.654
And then suddenly Whiz-hoo!

30
00:01:56.295 --> 00:01:57.756
Her eye laser beams fired!

31
00:01:58.944 --> 00:02:01.486
The elves' motorcycles exploded into little pieces.

32
00:02:01.506 --> 00:02:04.928
"Yes!" Roxy cheered.

33
00:02:04.948 --> 00:02:07.069
"Rocket Girl is back!"

34
00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:11.672
Roxy used her X-ray vision and looked into the clubhouse.

35
00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:15.774
The elves were sitting at a table and playing cards.

36
00:02:18.936 --> 00:02:20.557
Roxy listened with her super hearing.

37
00:02:20.577 --> 00:02:25.280
"Ha-ha!" The elf leader laughed.

38
00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:29.782
"Rocket Girl is the worst superhero in the world!"

39
00:02:29.802 --> 00:02:32.324
"Yeah!" said another elf.

40
00:02:32.344 --> 00:02:35.045
"We took away her super powers!"

41
00:02:36.266 --> 00:02:38.928
"You mean I took away her super powers!"

42
00:02:39.288 --> 00:02:40.149
said the elf leader.

43
00:02:40.169 --> 00:02:42.490
"Of course, boss," said the elf.

44
00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:45.452
"You took away her super powers."

45
00:02:46.373 --> 00:02:48.054
"Let's rob some banks tomorrow!"

46
00:02:48.274 --> 00:02:49.114
said a third elf.

47
00:02:50.175 --> 00:02:51.256
All the elves laughed.

48
00:02:55.692 --> 00:02:57.553
"Those elves are going to be sorry!"

49
00:02:57.813 --> 00:02:58.493
thought Roxy.

50
00:02:59.113 --> 00:03:00.574
She blasted off into the air.

51
00:03:06.416 --> 00:03:12.519
Terrell was looking through the He gasped.

52
00:03:12.839 --> 00:03:13.880
"Rocket Girl!"

53
00:03:17.241 --> 00:03:21.263
Zoom! Roxy shot back down to earth and smashed into the clubhouse.

54
00:03:23.884 --> 00:03:27.888
Ka-boom! Pieces went everywhere.

55
00:03:32.570 --> 00:03:34.910
clubhouse!" cried the elf leader.

56
00:03:36.271 --> 00:03:37.251
He held up his hand.

57
00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:40.972
Zap! Electricity shot toward Roxy.

58
00:03:41.892 --> 00:03:43.333
Roxy blocked the electricity.

59
00:03:44.253 --> 00:03:47.474
Zap-pow! The sparks flew back at the elf leader.

60
00:03:48.634 --> 00:03:51.435
Electricity buzzed through him, and he fell to the floor.

61
00:03:53.536 --> 00:03:54.416
Roxy smiled.

62
00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.921
"You elves are going to jail."

63
00:04:01.802 --> 00:04:04.403
back!" said Roxy, walking into Jack's backyard.

64
00:04:05.263 --> 00:04:07.084
Terrell was still looking through the telescope.

65
00:04:08.204 --> 00:04:11.565
"Terrell thinks he saw Rocket Girl in space," said Mara.

66
00:04:12.285 --> 00:04:13.186
Terrell frowned.

67
00:04:13.206 --> 00:04:14.186
"I did!"

68
00:04:14.206 --> 00:04:18.067
"I believe you," said Roxy.

69
00:04:18.087 --> 00:04:20.668
"Can I have a turn with the telescope now?"
